  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">길들이기(Taming)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit_1/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">테이밍스킬수치표</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anit_2/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">주요스폰장소</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_anil/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">동물지식(Animal Lore)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_vet/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">동물붕대힐(Veterinary)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_vet_he/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">목동술(Herding)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>HERDING</b></span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"right\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/logo_he.gif\" width=\"100\"></b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">직업 \n                            타이틀: </span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Shepherd</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            주 상승 스탯: Strength</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            부가 상승 스탯: </span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Dexterity</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬사용 \n                            : 해당 스킬 사용(지팡이-Crook)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">수련 \n                            가능 NPC: </span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ranger \n                            Guildmaster, Shepherd, Rancher</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬 \n                            Up: 난이도</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"white\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>A</b>. \n                                        허딩은 동물이나 몬스터를 원하는 위치로 \n                                        이동시켜주는 스킬입니다. 쉽게 말하자면 \n                                        몹몰이로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이해할 \n                                        수 있습니다. 대장간에 있는 NPC에게 Crook이라는 \n                                        지팡이를 구입 하신 후 해당 지팡이를</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">더블클릭 \n                                        후 동물이나 몬스터를 선택, 원하시는 \n                                        위치를 지정 하시면 해당 동물이나 몬스터가</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지정한 \n                                        장소까지 이동하게 됩니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬이 \n                                        낮은 경우에는 토끼나 쥐같은 하위 동물부터 \n                                        올리셔야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>B</b>. \n                                        허딩의 쓰임새는 위급한 상황에서 몹을 \n                                        다른 곳으로 이동시켜 주는 것인데, 원거리 \n                                        공격을</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하는 \n                                        마사나 아쳐의 경우 공격하면서 해당 스킬로 \n                                        안전하게 사냥할 수 있는 장점이 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하지만 \n                                        그 쓰임새의 유용성이 희박하여 현재는 \n                                        거의 사장된 스킬중에 하나입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written By Forg</span></b></font></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n",
